\itemize{
\item \strong{differences}: \eqn{\Delta Se = Se_R - Se_{R'}},
\eqn{\Delta Sp = Sp_R - Sp_{R'}} and, for the Youden index
\eqn{J_R = Se_R + Sp_R - 1}, which summarises the accuracy in one number
(0 for a useless test, 1 for a perfect one),
